  "description": "San Diego is a powerhouse in bike life, and we wanted to honor America’s Finest City with the latest addition to our SE city-themed lineup. This San Diego Big Ripper screams Daygo —from the friar numberplate to the San Diego Bicycle Club padset and sprocket, all the way to a colorway that’s ready to slide straight into home plate. Whether you’re cruising from Mission Bay to Downtown on an SD Biking group ride, raising it up in Pacific Beach, or ripping through one of the area’s pump tracks and trails, this bike is built to knock it out of the park. The San Diego Big Ripper is a limited-edition release, with only 250 bikes available. Picture your crew rolling past the stadium —sun’s out, wheels up, crowd buzzing—now that’s a grand slam!",
